      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Toys",
        "text_sha256": "fd16c1f32fde488dcf063ec7d1d22e9e410e2748242e6db165c2b982fd0cdebd",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Feeding your baby can come with challenges, whether you’re breastfeeding, bottle feeding or doing a combination of the two. Fortunately, there are a wide range of products that can help eliminate (most of) the feeding frenzy and make mealtime a little more enjoyable for you and baby. Here, you’ll find our guides to the best breastfeeding, pumping, and bottle feeding gear, along with some helpful tips for dealing with a hangry baby.",
        "text_sha256": "044b6fcd3244c596bcc74a82db2268127ee7c966e3f9b63ab4d885c3818e0b44",
        "word_count": 72
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "In This Section",
        "text_sha256": "7041f45df2897ef42f226aa64587fe33b08b58486f7c2e6ef3e4b57a9f86f725",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Breastfeeding Essentials",
        "text_sha256": "8cdc3a88121d05b53b52c7afe0b07643fe849c6fe0b04717ae6c58fcfedd9465",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Breastfeeding seems simple enough: Baby, meet breast. But as moms who's done it will tell you, a few nursing essentials can make a big difference.",
        "text_sha256": "3a8586b4ca4a62876005c70ae718c611c41ff5e481e4ca8b2c5439e34a50b1a4",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Bottle Feeding Essentials",
        "text_sha256": "1c329adaeaca1797264572c5b04e12a54a738eb6b2b4ff40f0c772e3cfd337bc",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether you're exclusively bottle-feeding, supplementing with formula or pumped breastmilk, or making the switch from breast to bottle, here's what you'll need to establish a healthy bottle-feeding routine.",
        "text_sha256": "bfea9016068f20614f58870103f5ead213d157d0bf56e9b2275862e1f62270c6",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Formula Feeding",
        "text_sha256": "1c8396516c17bd591bca8faa8feb47f82a0218d2e5735a3ba4e4d7aa86eecba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
